WEBVTT

00:12:58.727 --> 00:13:02.361
so each hemisphere tilts
towards the sun for half the year,

00:13:02.385 --> 00:13:04.309
and away for the other half.

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:05.884
[Not to scale!]

00:13:05.908 --> 00:13:07.074
Better put that up.

00:13:07.098 --> 00:13:08.384
(Laughter)

00:13:08.408 --> 00:13:11.648
That's a good explanation:

00:13:11.672 --> 00:13:13.094
hard to vary,

00:13:13.118 --> 00:13:16.208
because every detail
plays a functional role.

00:13:16.232 --> 00:13:19.084
For instance, we know,
independently of seasons,

00:13:19.108 --> 00:13:24.160
that surfaces tilted away
from radiant heat are heated less,

00:13:24.184 --> 00:13:27.150
and that a spinning sphere, in space,

00:13:27.174 --> 00:13:29.469
points in a constant direction.

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:33.302
And the tilt also explains